# Mimir's Elixir (Q235), from cond 3 (a scenario holds no Star of Destiny, so the offer and
# the accept are in tests/quest/q235_flow_test.go): Joan sends the player after a Chimera
# Piece, whose sage stone (draw 0, under 200000 of 1000000) she trades for true gold; Ladd
# takes the gold for the magister's mixing stone; a Bloody Guardian's blood fire (draw 0)
# readies the mixing; the urn takes the mixing stone, then turns the player away for want of
# pure silver. Expectations are derived from the reference source (Q235_MimirsElixir.java,
# Quest.dropItems).
trace internal/gameserver/script/testdata/oracle/scenarios/q235_mimirs_elixir.golden
character Alchemist 75
quest Q235_MimirsElixir <state>=STARTED <cond>=3
random 0 0
script quest.Q235_MimirsElixir
